# 36 Spokes environment variables
#
# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) and fill in what you need. Nothing is
# required in Phase 2: every integration stays off until its values are set.
#
# Only VITE_* variables reach the browser. Read them through src/lib/env.ts.

# Absolute site origin, no trailing slash. Enables canonical URLs, og:url and
# absolute social images. Set this on Vercel for production.
VITE_SITE_URL=http://localhost:8080/

# Phase 3: Supabase. The anon key is public by design; row-level security protects data.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://gnzwtmhngabmycpndier.supabase.co/rest/v1/
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=sb_publishable_4mKTkGJbCSbLmpWu8O_70w_A8Pk8FyA

# Phase 4: Mapbox public token. Restrict it to your domains in the Mapbox dashboard.
VITE_MAPBOX_TOKEN=

# Phase 3: Razorpay key id (public).
VITE_RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=

# Server-only secrets. Never prefix these with VITE_ and never read them in
# src/lib/env.ts. They belong in TanStack Start server functions from Phase 3.
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
# RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=
